      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Setting it down\" means letting go of the impossible expectation that you have to fix everything, all the time. The pain you feel is a signal that the struggle itself is the problem, not the world around you. Peace isn't found in *stopping*, but in finding a way to stop *fighting* the unbearable. There are ways to make the noise stop, and they don't have to be this painful, endless battle.",
