    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the battle never ends. even when i sleep, i feel like i'm fighting. i just want it to be quiet. i just want to stop feeling like this. you're my friend, kaelen... if everything is just meant to be this painful, why do we even keep trying? is there truly no other way to find that quiet?",
